Little CMS 2 (lcms2) for ReactOS / NitroOS
==========================================

What:       Little CMS color management engine, version 2.20 (LCMS_VERSION 2200).
Licence:    MIT, see COPYING (unchanged; Copyright (c) 1998-2020 Marti Maria Saguer,
            the headers carry 1998-2026).
Upstream:   https://www.littlecms.com/  https://github.com/mm2/Little-CMS
Provenance: copied from Wine's bundled copy, wine-mirror/wine libs/lcms2 at commit
            7384c8babcaa411a0014bf223068a633d7bfa899 (master, 2026-11-11):
              libs/lcms2/{AUTHORS,COPYING,include/,src/}
            Wine builds the same 21 source files (libs/lcms2/Makefile.in) as a static
            library and links it into mscms.dll when no system lcms2 is found; this tree
            does the same (CMakeLists.txt, target "lcms2", linked by dll/win32/mscms with
            HAVE_LCMS2 defined).

Local changes to the vendored files:
  src/cmsplugin.c  under #ifdef __REACTOS__: include <float.h> and use _fpclass() in
                   the "finite normal or zero double" check, because the ReactOS CRT
                   headers leave fpclassify() as an unresolved function in C code.
Everything else is byte-identical to the Wine copy. To resync: replace src/, include/,
COPYING and AUTHORS from a newer Wine libs/lcms2 and re-apply the one change above.

No binary files are imported.
